<title>CANADA: Bank Canada sets 2nd round of specials at 3.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank Canada sets 2nd round of specials at 3.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada set a second round of special purchase and resale agreements in the money markets at 3.5 percent.</p>
</text>
